## 2. Technology Stack & Architecture

### 2.1 Full Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| **UI Framework** | React | 18.x | Component-based user interface |
| **Language** | TypeScript | 5.x | Type safety, developer productivity |
| **Build Tool** | Vite | 5.x | Fast dev server, optimised bundling |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS | 3.x | Utility-first responsive styling |
| **Component Library** | Shadcn/UI | Latest | Accessible, unstyled base components |
| **Routing** | React Router | 6.x | Client-side multi-page navigation |
| **Data Fetching** | TanStack Query | 5.x | Server state management, caching |
| **Backend / Database** | Supabase (PostgreSQL) | Latest | Auth, DB, realtime, edge functions |
| **Authentication** | Supabase Auth | — | JWT-based, email/password |
| **Audio** | Web Audio API | Native | Programmatic sound synthesis, TTS |
| **Icons** | Lucide React | Latest | Consistent SVG icon system |
| **Animations** | CSS animations + Tailwind | — | Bounce, spin, fade, celebrate effects |

