## 5. Database Schema

All tables are hosted in a Supabase (PostgreSQL) instance with **Row-Level Security (RLS)** enabled on every table. No table is publicly readable without authentication.

### 5.1 Table: `profiles`

Stores one profile record per authenticated parent user. Created automatically via database trigger on signup.

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | PK, DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() | Unique profile ID |
| `user_id` | UUID | FK → auth.users, UNIQUE, NOT NULL | Links to Supabase Auth user |
| `email` | TEXT | — | Parent email address |
| `display_name` | TEXT | — | Parent display name |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL, DEFAULT now() | Account creation time |
| `updated_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL, DEFAULT now() | Last updated (auto-trigger) |

### 5.2 Table: `user_roles`

Stores role assignments. Currently only the `parent` role is used. Designed to support future educator/admin roles.

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | PK | Unique row ID |
| `user_id` | UUID | FK → auth.users, NOT NULL | User reference |
| `role` | ENUM (app_role) | NOT NULL | `'parent'` or `'child'` |
| — | — | UNIQUE(user_id, role) | One role per user |

### 5.3 Table: `child_profiles`

Core entity representing a child learner under a parent account.

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | PK | Unique child ID |
| `parent_id` | UUID | FK → auth.users, NOT NULL | Owning parent |
| `name` | TEXT | NOT NULL | Child's first name |
| `age` | INTEGER | CHECK (1–25) | Child's age (updated constraint) |
| `avatar` | TEXT | DEFAULT 'default' | Avatar identifier string |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL | Profile creation time |
| `updated_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL | Last modified |

### 5.4 Table: `parental_settings`

One settings row per parent, created on signup via trigger.

| Column | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | gen_random_uuid() | PK |
| `parent_id` | UUID | — | FK → auth.users (UNIQUE) |
| `session_duration_minutes` | INTEGER | 30 | Max session length |
| `sound_enabled` | BOOLEAN | true | Enable game sounds |
| `animations_enabled` | BOOLEAN | true | Enable animations |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | now() | Creation time |
| `updated_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | now() | Last modified |

### 5.5 Table: `game_sessions`

A record is inserted at the end of every game a child plays.

| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | PK | Session ID |
| `child_id` | UUID | FK → child_profiles, NOT NULL | Playing child |
| `game_type` | TEXT | NOT NULL | e.g., `'alphabet'`, `'colors'` |
| `score` | INTEGER | NOT NULL, DEFAULT 0 | Final score |
| `total_questions` | INTEGER | NOT NULL | Always 10 |
| `correct_answers` | INTEGER | NOT NULL | Correct count |
| `wrong_answers` | INTEGER | NOT NULL | Wrong count |
| `mistakes` | JSONB | DEFAULT '[]' | Array of mistake detail objects |
| `max_streak` | INTEGER | NOT NULL | Best consecutive streak |
| `duration_seconds` | INTEGER | DEFAULT 0 | How long the session took |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL | Session date |

**Indexes**: `child_id`, `game_type`, `created_at DESC`

### 5.6 Table: `child_behavior_profiles`

One row per child, maintained by the Adaptive AI engine. Records long-term learning patterns and preferences.

| Column | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | gen_random_uuid() | PK |
| `child_id` | UUID | — | FK → child_profiles (UNIQUE) |
| `preferred_pace` | VARCHAR(20) | `'normal'` | `slow`, `normal`, or `fast` |
| `attention_span_minutes` | INTEGER | 10 | Estimated focus duration |
| `best_time_of_day` | VARCHAR(20) | `'morning'` | `morning`, `afternoon`, `evening` |
| `prefers_sounds` | BOOLEAN | true | Audio preference |
| `prefers_animations` | BOOLEAN | true | Animation preference |
| `color_sensitivity` | VARCHAR(20) | `'normal'` | Sensory color sensitivity |
| `average_accuracy` | DECIMAL(5,2) | 0 | Running average across sessions |
| `average_response_time_seconds` | DECIMAL(8,2) | 0 | Median answer speed |
| `frustration_threshold` | INTEGER | 3 | Wrong answers before AI intervenes |
| `strong_categories` | JSONB | `[]` | Games where accuracy ≥ 80% |
| `challenging_categories` | JSONB | `[]` | Games where accuracy < 50% |
| `current_difficulty_level` | INTEGER | 1 | AI-managed level (1–5) |
| `recommended_games` | JSONB | `[]` | AI-suggested games to play next |
| `last_ai_analysis` | TIMESTAMPTZ | — | When AI last updated this profile |
| `ai_insights` | JSONB | `{}` | Freeform AI observations |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | now() | — |
| `updated_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | now() | Auto-updated by trigger |

### 5.7 Table: `remote_control_settings`

One row per child. Updated by parents in real-time. Games read this table to apply parent-configured constraints.

| Column | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | gen_random_uuid() | PK |
| `child_id` | UUID | — | FK → child_profiles (UNIQUE) |
| `parent_id` | UUID | — | FK → auth.users |
| `difficulty_level` | INTEGER | 3 | Manual override (1–5) |
| `auto_adjust_difficulty` | BOOLEAN | true | Let AI adjust difficulty |
| `enabled_categories` | JSONB | All categories | Which game types are allowed |
| `daily_time_limit` | INTEGER | 30 | Minutes per day |
| `learning_goals` | JSONB | `[]` | Parent-set learning objectives |
| `focus_mode` | BOOLEAN | false | Reduces UI distractions |
| `age_filter` | INTEGER | 5 | Content age appropriateness |
| `content_filter_level` | TEXT | `'standard'` | `standard`, `strict`, `relaxed` |
| `schedule` | JSONB | `[]` | Daily schedule entries |
| `milestone_notifications` | JSONB | `[]` | Alerts for milestones |
| `break_reminders` | BOOLEAN | true | Enable break alerts |
| `break_interval_minutes` | INTEGER | 15 | How often to suggest breaks |
| `max_games_per_session` | INTEGER | 10 | Cap on games per sitting |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | now() | — |
| `updated_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | now() | Auto-updated by trigger |

**Realtime**: This table is published to the Supabase realtime channel so parent changes propagate instantly to the child's active game session.

