```

### 7.3 Data Store Descriptions

| Data Store | Tables Used | Written By | Read By |
|---|---|---|---|
| DS1 — User Accounts | profiles, user_roles, parental_settings | Process 1 (signup trigger) | Process 1, 4 |
| DS2 — Child Registry | child_profiles | Process 1 (parent creates) | Process 2, 3, 4 |
| DS3 — Game History | game_sessions | Process 2 (end of game) | Process 4 |
| DS4 — AI Profile | child_behavior_profiles | Process 3 (AI updates) | Process 2, 3, 4 |
| DS5 — Remote Config | remote_control_settings | Process 5 (parent) | Process 2 (realtime) |

