## 10. Hooks & API Reference

### 10.1 [useAdaptiveAI(childId)](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useAdaptiveAI.ts#61-388)

**Location**: [src/hooks/useAdaptiveAI.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useAdaptiveAI.ts)
**Purpose**: Manages the cloud-based AI session — fetches/creates the behavior profile, tracks consecutive correct/wrong answers, and calls the edge function for encouragement and hints.

```typescript
const {
  behaviorProfile,       // BehaviorProfile | null — loaded from DB
  isLoading,             // boolean — true while AI call in-flight
  encouragement,         // string | null — message shown when struggling
  hint,                  // string | null — hint for current question
  realTimeSupport,       // RealTimeSupport | null — UI adjustment flags
  trackCorrect,          // () => void — call on correct answer
  trackWrong,            // (gameData) => Promise — call on wrong answer
  requestHint,           // (gameData, question) => Promise
  checkRealTimeSupport,  // (gameData) => Promise
  getSessionSummary,     // (gameData) => Promise<string>
  adjustDifficulty,      // (gameData) => Promise
  updateStats,           // (correct, total, gameType) => Promise
  resetSession,          // () => void — resets all counters
  clearMessages,         // () => void — dismisses encouragement/hint
  consecutiveWrong,      // number — current wrong streak
  currentStreak,         // number — current correct streak
  aiTrace,               // AdaptiveAIEvent[] — last 20 AI calls (debug)
} = useAdaptiveAI(childId);
```

### 10.2 [useAdaptiveDifficulty(config?)](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useAdaptiveDifficulty.ts#45-204)

**Location**: [src/hooks/useAdaptiveDifficulty.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useAdaptiveDifficulty.ts)
**Purpose**: Client-side reactive difficulty engine. No network calls. Updates after every answer.

```typescript
const {
  state,               // DifficultyState — full state object
  getQuestionDifficulty, // () => 'easy' | 'hard'
  recordCorrect,       // () => void
  recordWrong,         // () => void
  reset,               // () => void
  aiRecommendation,    // { level: string, message: string }
  currentDifficulty,   // 'easy' | 'hard'
  currentAccuracy,     // number (0–100)
  questionsAnswered,   // number
} = useAdaptiveDifficulty(config?);
```

### 10.3 `useAuth()`

**Location**: [src/hooks/useAuth.tsx](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useAuth.tsx)
**Purpose**: Provides the authenticated user and session.

```typescript
const { user, session, loading, signIn, signUp, signOut } = useAuth();
```

### 10.4 `useSoundEffects()`

**Location**: [src/hooks/useSoundEffects.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useSoundEffects.ts)
**Purpose**: Web Audio API sound generation. All sounds are synthesised — no audio files needed.

```typescript
const { playCorrect, playWrong, playComplete, playClick } = useSoundEffects();
```

### 10.5 `useTextToSpeech()`

**Location**: [src/hooks/useTextToSpeech.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useTextToSpeech.ts)
**Purpose**: Wraps the Web Speech API's `SpeechSynthesisUtterance` for kid-friendly voice output.

```typescript
const { speak, stop, isSpeaking } = useTextToSpeech();
speak("Apple starts with which letter?"); // reads aloud immediately
```

### 10.6 `useGameStats(childId)`

**Location**: [src/hooks/useGameStats.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useGameStats.ts)
**Purpose**: Fetches and computes aggregated game statistics for the reports dashboard.

```typescript
const { stats, loading, getChildStats } = useGameStats(childId);
// stats includes: totalGames, averageAccuracy, bestGame, worstGame, recentSessions[]
```

### 10.7 `useParentAlerts()`

**Location**: [src/hooks/useParentAlerts.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useParentAlerts.ts)
**Purpose**: Manages the alert queue and triggers milestone/struggle notifications.

```typescript
const { alerts, checkForMilestones, checkForStruggles, clearAlert } = useParentAlerts();
```

### 10.8 `useRemoteControlSettings(childId)`

**Location**: [src/hooks/useRemoteControlSettings.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useRemoteControlSettings.ts)
**Purpose**: Fetches and subscribes to real-time updates on a child's remote settings.

```typescript
const { settings, updateSettings, isLoading } = useRemoteControlSettings(childId);
```

### 10.9 `useRewardSystem(childId)`

**Location**: [src/hooks/useRewardSystem.ts](file:///p:/Project%20nuero/nk5/neuro-frontend/neuronest-kids/src/hooks/useRewardSystem.ts)
**Purpose**: Tracks badges, milestones, and reward state across sessions.

```typescript
const { rewards, badges, checkForNewBadge, totalPoints } = useRewardSystem(childId);
```

